{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20262eV6efe6qb1794911070.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>日本指，兩架俄羅斯飛機闖入福岡縣附近日本領空，自衛隊戰機緊急升空應對。日本向俄方抗議但未獲回應。</p><p></p><p>日本防衛省指，當地周二凌晨4時07分至4時10分，以及凌晨4時09分至4時12分，有兩架俄羅斯飛機進入福岡縣附近領空。日本航空自衛隊戰機緊急升空應對，並警告上述飛機離開。這兩架飛機通過對馬海峽後，一路南下，經過日本與那國島和台灣之間的上空飛向太平洋。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.JP.RUS-1830-1_CLEAN_20261117_181537.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026XSkpy0hSq81794911078.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>日本防衛大臣小泉進次郎稱，已向俄羅斯提出嚴正抗議，要求防止類似事件再發生。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.JP.RUS-1830-1_CLEAN_20261117_181537_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026GaHuktzZ8E1794911089.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>日本防衛大臣小泉進次郎說：「俄羅斯飛機侵犯我們(日本)的領空，不僅嚴重侵犯我們的主權，也威脅我們的安全，這是完全不可接受的。」</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.JP.RUS-1830-1_CLEAN_20261117_181537_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026nbPaqW2Jpo1794911103.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>近期日俄關係進一步惡化，八月俄羅斯總統普京首次登上與日本有主權爭議的南千島群島伊圖魯普島，即日方稱的擇捉島視察，日方提出強烈抗議。上月中旬，俄羅斯拘捕一名日本記者，指他從事間諜活動，兩國緊張局勢再度升溫。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-17T10:52:40.955247+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":379,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-17T09:28:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T07:10:40.322999+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-17T10:46:00.318225+00:00","content_hash":"3b41fb432ae1f6f0a06def92a27ebf5625737dc61412ae72de7520e4ce00b5c9","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-17T10:52:40.955247+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}